      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The bicycle ergometry has proved as screening test for the diagnostics of the latent coronary insufficiency. Taking into consideration well-known prerequisites, indications, contraindications, the criteria of withdrawal and the ECG criteria in coronary insufficiency own results and experiences from an analysis of 1,000 bicycle ergometries are presented and compared with literary data."},
